# TMDB API Read Access Token (v4 auth) — https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# SERVER-SIDE ONLY. Read by the /api/tmdb proxy (Cloudflare Pages Function) and by the
# vite dev proxy — never baked into the client bundle. Set it in .env locally
# and as a secret on the Cloudflare Pages project. Never commit a real token.
TMDB_TOKEN=

